does it COMPILE?
  (?R)     false
  (?1)     false
  (?&p)    false
  \g<0>    false

unrolled to depth 4, 55 characters of pattern:
  \((?:[^()]|\((?:[^()]|\((?:[^()]|\([^()]*\))*\))*\))*\)

how deep does it reach?
  depth 1  (a)            true
  depth 2  ((a))          true
  depth 3  (((a)))        true
  depth 4  ((((a))))      true
  depth 5  (((((a)))))    false
  depth 6  ((((((a))))))  false

the pattern cannot be written to reach every depth: each level
is another copy of the one below it, and there is no last level.
